  "body": "After registering in the home space, the user of this domain space has the right to create a space. This results in the server administrator being unaware of these spaces and what is going on there. There may be a situation for the distribution of good content. The second point is that the server administrator does not see and cannot delete already created spaces. I simulated a situation where a space was created, the space name was taken, and the administrator left all the rooms and the space itself. So I have a few questions:\r\n\r\n1) how to forbid to create spaces?\r\n2) how to view all created spaces on your server?\r\n3) how to remove spaces ?\r\n4) how to delete spaces and rooms created by other users. ?",
